# CAST local PII deny-list template
#
# Usage:
#   Copy this file to ~/.claude/config/pii-denylist-local.txt and fill in
#   your own work/personal identifiers. The pre-push gate reads that file
#   before every push — patterns are never committed to the repo itself.
#
# Format:
#   - One extended regular expression (ERE) per line
#   - Lines beginning with # are comments and are ignored
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Patterns are matched case-insensitively
#   - Use ERE syntax: dots, pipes, brackets, +, ?, {n,m}, etc.
#
# Examples (commented out — replace with your own):
#
# your-employer-name
# your-internal-project-codename
# your-username
# firstname\.lastname@company\.com
# internal-tool-[0-9]+
